# Emberheart Challenger's valiant exiles the top card and "you may play that card" until end of turn: a nonland card is
# CAST from exile, paid for as usual (this one costs {0}). On Bot1's own turn 3 Snakeskin Veil targets the Challenger for
# the first time that turn (+1/+1 counter, hexproof); the trigger exiles Mox Sapphire, which Bot1 then casts from exile the
# same turn and which stays on the battlefield. Power: 2 + the counter + 1 prowess for the Veil + 1 prowess for the Mox
# Sapphire (both noncreature spells) = 5. Positive control for the scenario where the permission expires unused.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Emberheart Challenger
Snakeskin Veil
